<title>USA: Health Care Q3 investment activity $50 mln.</title>
<headline>Health Care Q3 investment activity $50 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said on Friday investment activity in the third quarter 1996 totalled $50 million and for the nine months ended September 30, 1996, the company funded investments of $151.5 million.</p>
<p>Third quarter acquisitions and financing included four nursing homes and one assisted living facility operated by five different operators in five different states, it said.</p>
<p>Health Care said third quarter funding included $10.6 million of operating leases and $6.3 million of mortgage loans. Construction advances totalled $33.1 million, it said.</p>
</text>
